; orchard_arena.room - Colina do Guardiao: the autumn guardian's arena, empty until GRD-04 (design 04 section 3.6).
; Flat floor top at row 9 across all 40 cells, no pits, nine rows of air; the guardian stands at col 25.

; The chimney gate: the cliff chimney (west) cannot be climbed back out without wall climb, so a
; barrier holds its mouth until the save holds it (design 04 section 3.6; no softlock while GRD-04 is open).
; The stone lintel (cols 0-2, rows 0-4) leaves 32 px over the barrier, so it is no step, and its top is 288 px
; over the floor (double jump 270); the overhang at (3,0) stops a wall climb there (bugs/the-orchard-arena-barrier-is-jumped-over-into-the-cliff-chimney).

